  "content": "[Intro]\n[B]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[F#]Guess I got\nwhat I deserve\n[E]\n[A]Kept you wait-\n[E]ing there, too\n[B]long my love\n[F#]All that time,\nwithout a word\n[E]\n[A]Didn't know\n[E]you'd think, that\n[B]I'd forget,\nor\n[F#]I'd regret\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#m]The special love\nI have for you\n[E]\nMy baby blue\n\n[Interlude]\n[B]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F#]All the days\nbecame so long\n[E]\n[A]Did you real-\n[E]ly think I'd\n[B]do you wrong\n[F#]Dixie,\nwhen I let you go\n[E]\n[A]Thought you'd re-\n[E]alize,\n[B]I would know,\n[F#]I would show\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#m]The special love\nI have for you\n[E]\nMy baby blue\n\n[Interlude]\n[B]\n\n[Bridge]\n[D#m]What can I do,\n[G#m]\n[G#m/G]What can I sa-\n[C#m]y?\n[A]Except that I\n[E]want you by my\n[B]side\n[D#m]How can I show\n[G#m]you?\n[G#m/G]Show me a wa-\n[C#m]y\n[A]Don't you\n[E]know, the times I tri-\n\n[Solo]\n[D]ed\n[A]\n[E]\n[B]\n[D]\n[A]\n[E]\n[B]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[F#]Guess that's all\nI have to say\n[E]\n[A]Except the feel-\n[E]ing just gets stron-\n[B]ger everyday\n[F#]Just one thing,\nbefore I go\n[E]\n[A]Take good care,\n[E]baby\n[B]let me know,\n[F#]let it show\n\n[Chorus]\n[C#m]The special love\nyou have for me\n[E]\nMy Dixie dear\n\n[Outro]\n[B]\n[C#m]\n[A]\n[E]\n[B]",
